(
    title: "Gas Hog",
    description: Some("On an alien battlefield you drive a laser-armed car across the terrain, blasting or leaping the craft that swarm in while dodging the bombs a ship overhead keeps dropping. The catch is fuel: your tank drains fast, and once it runs dry you must turn back to collect gas — surrendering hard-won ground — before pressing on toward the far side."),
